---
import InnerLayout from "../layouts/InnerLayout.astro";
---

<InnerLayout>
  <section class="about">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="text-container">
        <h2>ABOUT US</h2>
        <h3>OUR STORY</h3>
        <p>
          Founded as Certified Trainings Center, known as BIM Trainings in 2015.
          After that, we organized BIM GROUP forming new BIMATS in 2016
          specializing in network and security, collaboration solutions, system
          and storage, Managed Service, Consultancy Services, Professional
          Services, Support Services, and other software official license
          providing.
        </p>
        <p>
          We are uniquely positioned to leverage our depth and expertise to
          provide a comprehensive solution to all IT infrastructure
          requirements.We, BIM is organized with certified engineers who have
          the network design, management, and troubleshooting skills that come
          from years of training and hands-on experience. BIM provides expert
          service to help you maintain mission-critical systems, improve network
          efficiency, plan for growth, and rapidly recover from network
          problems.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="img-container">
        <img src="/images/about/deposit.jpg" alt="" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="mission">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="img-container">
        <img src="/images/about/vision.jpg" alt="" />
      </div>
      <div class="text-container">
        <h3>Our Mission</h3>
        <p>
          To help our clients from inception through completion, for all their
          business IT needs. Our Strategies are the followings :
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Understanding customers’ needs as a service-oriented company.</li>
          <li>
            Solving your business challenges with our high performance services
          </li>
          <li>
            Exploring new technologies with qualified IT Specialist and Helping
            customers’ business improved and successful
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="vision">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="text-container">
        <h3>Our Vision</h3>
        <p>
          To become a preferred IT Service partner that fulfills your needs. It
          has changed from small startup to highly reliable supplier for the
          customers, advanced business goals and promoted well-qualified IT
          Experts in the industry.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="img-container">
        <img src="/images/about/vision.jpg" alt="" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</InnerLayout>
